<view class="page" wx:if="{{result}}">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="verdict-chip {{chipClass}}">
      {{result.verdict === 'keep' ? '可以放心留下' : (result.verdict === 'observe' ? '先别急着决定' : '也许能说再见了')}}
    </view>
    <view class="item-card">
      <view class="li-head">
        <view class="item-title">{{result.title}}</view>
        <view><text class="score-big">{{result.score}}</text><text class="score-unit">/100 留</text></view>
      </view>
      <view class="reason">{{result.reason}}</view>
      <view class="reason" wx:if="{{result.advice}}" style="color:#1a8f4a;">{{result.advice}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="item-card">
    <view class="q-title">我是从这六个方面看的</view>
    <view class="dim-row" wx:for="{{dims}}" wx:key="key">
      <view class="dim-head"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.value}}</text></view>
      <view class="dim-bar"><view class="dim-fill {{item.cls}}" style="width:{{item.value}}%"></view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="foot-note" style="text-align:left;margin-top:16rpx;">
      分数越高，越偏向留下；「占用空间」分高说明它不占地儿。这些只是我的参考，最后怎么定，听你的。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="item-card">
    <view class="q-title">想好了吗？轮到你了</view>
    <button class="btn-primary" data-decision="keep" bindtap="onChoose" loading="{{chooseLoading === 'keep'}}" disabled="{{chooseLoading}}">留下它</button>
    <button class="btn-ghost" data-decision="observe" bindtap="onChoose" loading="{{chooseLoading === 'observe'}}" disabled="{{chooseLoading}}">再想想（冷静 30 天）</button>
    <button class="btn-ghost" data-choice="transfer" bindtap="onToggleChoice" disabled="{{chooseLoading}}">卖掉或送人</button>
    <view class="li-actions" wx:if="{{expandedChoice === 'transfer'}}">
      <view class="li-btn li-btn-main" data-decision="sell" bindtap="onChoose">卖掉</view>
      <view class="li-btn li-btn-main" data-decision="gift" bindtap="onChoose">送人</view>
    </view>
    <button class="btn-ghost" data-choice="dispose" bindtap="onToggleChoice" disabled="{{chooseLoading}}">送它走</button>
    <view class="li-actions" wx:if="{{expandedChoice === 'dispose'}}">
      <view class="li-btn" data-decision="recycle" bindtap="onChoose">回收</view>
      <view class="li-btn" data-decision="discard" bindtap="onChoose">扔掉</view>
    </view>
    <button class="btn-text" bindtap="onRetry" disabled="{{chooseLoading}}">重新答题</button>
  </view>
</view>
<view class="loading" wx:else>加载中...</view>
